== G0 main, unchanged
   exit=0
== G1 crate purba-configuration, line names no crate
   A crate named purba-<part> is refused when <part> is no part of the diagram, because the check reads the arrows of a part only. Name the part in the landscape, or rename the crate.
     purba-configuration, in crates/configuration/Cargo.toml
   exit=1
== G2 crate named by the line, uses nothing
   exit=0
== G3 crate uses purba-errors
   The crate of a concern uses no part, because each part may use it. Remove the dependency.
     purba-configuration uses errors, in crates/configuration/Cargo.toml
   exit=1
== G4 crate uses purba-selection
   The crate of a concern uses no part, because each part may use it. Remove the dependency.
     purba-configuration uses selection, in crates/configuration/Cargo.toml
   exit=1
