== G6 execution uses the crate
   A part may use the crate of a concern only when the concern's line names the part, because no arrow of the parts diagram draws that use. Name the part in the concern's line, or remove the dependency.
     execution uses purba-configuration, in crates/execution/Cargo.toml
   exit=1
